# Cloudflare Pages redirects (copied into dist/ as is; both lines, www and the apex alike).
#
# A store discount link, https://www.seemyhealth.ai/discount/<code>/ (cmh-golang's shop module builds
# them; the apps open them). The store is headless, so Shopify's own /discount/<code> on the store
# domain would not reach this site's cart: instead the shop page opens with ?discount=<code>, and the
# cart client (src/lib/shopify/cart-client.ts) keeps the code and puts it on the cart through the BFF
# (POST /api/cart/discount, or the next cart it creates). Shopify checks the code at checkout.
/discount/:code/  /shop/?discount=:code  302
/discount/:code   /shop/?discount=:code  302
